DESCRIPTION:Chicken Soup for the Soul Day marks a book that almost nobody w
 anted to publish. The first volume appeared in 1993\, after — by its co-
 author's own count — 144 publishers had turned the manuscript down\, and
  the series went on to become one of the largest franchises in American tr
 ade publishing. The observance itself has no documented origin\; the book'
 s history\, unusually for a day like this one\, does.\n\nhttps://todaycele
